{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41624","headline":"怀仙吟二首 二 · 陈陶","name":"怀仙吟二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云溪古流水，春晚桃花香。\n忆与我师别，片帆归沧浪。\n沧浪在何许，相思泪如雨。\n黄鹤不复来，云深难别处。\n石渠泉泠泠，三见菖蒲生。\n日夜劳梦魂，随波注东溟。\n空怀别时惠，长读消魔经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}